cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Training Data Visual Degradation and Object Transfer in GR00T N1.7:
  A Systematic Study
message: If you use this code or data, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Mohan
    family-names: Chillara
    affiliation: Wakeland High School, Frisco, TX
  - given-names: Aahan
    family-names: Kumbham
    affiliation: Panther Creek High School, Frisco, TX
repository-code: https://github.com/mohanchillara1/gr00trobustnessresearch
license: MIT
year: 2026
abstract: >-
  Six GR00T N1.7 checkpoints fine-tuned on the same LIBERO-Object
  demonstrations, differing only in the visual quality of the training video.
  Includes the conversion and degradation pipeline, the evaluation scripts, the
  raw evaluation logs, and the Object Transfer Score results for four novel
  objects.
keywords:
  - robot-learning
  - vision-language-action
  - GR00T
  - LIBERO
  - robustness
  - generalization
